content.text:
Add this to your `settings.json` (or `.vscode/settings.json` in your project):

```json
{
  "latex-workshop.latex.recipes": [
    {
      "name": "LuaLaTeX",
      "tools": ["lualatex"]
    }
  ],
  "latex-workshop.latex.tools": [
    {
      "name": "lualatex",
      "command": "lualatex",
      "args": [
        "-interaction=nonstopmode",
        "-shell-escape",
        "%DOC%"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Or if you want to add it to an existing recipes list, merge it in rather than replacing. Want me to open your settings.json and add this for you?

